---
layout: base
title: Snippets
description: Practical commands, scripts and procedures for everyday systems work.
permalink: /snippets/
---
<h1>Snippets</h1>
<p>{{ description }}</p>
<div class="entry-list">
{% for snippet in collections.snippet | newestFirst %}
  <section class="entry">
    <h2><a href="{{ snippet.url }}">{{ snippet.data.title }}</a></h2>
    <p>{{ snippet.data.description }}</p>
    <p class="meta">{{ snippet.data.category }}{% if snippet.data.platform %} · {{ snippet.data.platform }}{% endif %}</p>
  </section>
{% endfor %}
</div>
